   "source": [
    "# u-Segment3D 学习笔记 03：Direct 方法实战\n",
    "\n",
    "本笔记将以 Direct 聚合流程为主线，演示如何准备输入、加载参数并调用 `aggregate_2D_to_3D_segmentation_direct_method` 完成 3D 实例重建。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 函数入口\n",
    "Direct 方法的核心入口位于 `segment3D/usegment3d.py`：\n",
    "```python\n",
    "aggregate_2D_to_3D_segmentation_direct_method(\n",
    "    probs, grads, params,\n",
    "    voxel_size_um=None,\n",
    "    psf_params=None,\n",
    "    return_debug_data=False\n",
    ")\n",
    "```\n",
    "其中 `probs`、`grads` 是按正交视角组织的 list，内部元素可以是 numpy 数组或路径。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 构造示例输入\n",
    "真实项目中你会从 2D 分割模型（如 Cellpose、StarDist）获得概率和梯度。本示例使用随机数组模拟数据结构，重点展示 API 的使用方式。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from segment3D.parameters import get_2D_to_3D_aggregation_params\n",
    "from segment3D.usegment3d import aggregate_2D_to_3D_segmentation_direct_method\n",
    "\n",
    "# 构造三视角的假数据 (ZYX 体素顺序)\n",
    "shape = (32, 64, 64)\n",
    "probs = [np.random.rand(*shape) for _ in range(3)]\n",
    "grads = [np.random.rand(*shape, 3) for _ in range(3)]  # 每个体素的 x/y/z 梯度\n",
    "\n",
    "params = get_2D_to_3D_aggregation_params(method='direct')\n",
    "\n",
    "segmentation = aggregate_2D_to_3D_segmentation_direct_method(\n",
    "    probs=probs,\n",
    "    grads=grads,\n",
    "    params=params,\n",
    "    voxel_size_um=(0.5, 0.3, 0.3)\n",
    ")\n",
    "segmentation.shape
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> ⚠️ **注意**：本例使用随机数据，仅用于演示 API。实际结果需要来自真实的 2D 预测输出，否则分割毫无意义。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 调试技巧\n",
    "- 将 `return_debug_data=True`，可以同时返回内部生成的距离场、权重图等，有助于分析聚合质量。\n",
    "- 使用 `params['postprocessing'].min_size_voxels` 控制最小细胞体积，避免碎片。\n",
    "- 如果只有两个视角，可将缺失的视角传入空列表，如 `probs=[xy_probs, yz_probs, []]`。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 与教程脚本联动\n",
    "官方提供的 `tutorials/direct_method/` 脚本演示了完整的数据加载与结果保存流程。建议按照以下步骤实践：\n",
    "1. 打开 `tutorials/direct_method/run_direct_example.py`。\n",
    "2. 修改路径为你的数据位置（或示例数据）。\n",
    "3. 运行脚本，观察输出的 3D label `.tif` 文件。\n",
    "4. 对比本笔记的逐步调用，理解每一步在脚本中的实现。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 延伸阅读\n",
    "- `segment3D/flows.py`：生成 2D 流场的工具函数。\n",
    "- `segment3D/watershed.py`：包含自定义梯度下降与分水岭实现。\n",
    "- `segment3D/segmentation.py`：核心的三维聚合逻辑，可深入阅读获取算法细节。\n"
   ]
  }
